+ * The copy is 2.8 ms of the 16.7 a frame has, so the question "would the
+ * renderer reach 60 without it" has one boot for an answer: the seconds it
+ * is skipped show the rate the producer can sustain on its own, and the rest
+ * of the boot still shows the UI.
